osion of purpose, the collapse of meaning, the possibility that understanding this place might cost you something essential.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s all about attention. The car is your method. The liminal is your language. Drive into the silence, read the spaces, and decide whether comprehension is a form of salvation - or another way to disappear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010380/extras/c9cf82c0bfd0570531d7a5e03bc667ad.poster.avif?t=1761878375\" width=524 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010380/extras/c9cf82c0bfd0570531d7a5e03bc667ad.webm?t=1761878375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010380/extras/c9cf82c0bfd0570531d7a5e03bc667ad.mp4?t=1761878375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RC car as your eyes</strong> - Scout unreachable areas, trigger mechanisms, and find the way forward.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Liminal architecture</strong> - Minimal, repetitive structures that distort perception, evoke unease, and conceal meaning.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzle-first exploration </strong>- Spatial and timing-based puzzles revealed through observation rather than combat or evasion.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stages of grief </strong>- Each chapter reflects a phase of the K\u00fcbler-Ross model, blending emotion, memory, and space.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Narrative descent</strong> - Every solved secret draws you deeper into the in-between, where reality, memory, and acceptance begin to merge.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Suversa, Nana"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010380/7be496e47fdadc479b596f187b6eb04c113c51eb/header.jpg?t=1761878375","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3010380/1875171508/357f8f1e26700e216040ab27be3f617fbe6c1d5b/1761589732/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761590451","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3010380/1875171508/357f8f1e26700e216040ab27be3f617fbe6c1d5b/1761589732/dash_h264.mpd?t=1761590451","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3010380/1875171508/357f8f1e26700e216040ab27be3f617fbe6c1d5b/1761589732/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1761590451","id":257223292,"name":"Tape 101 - Official Demo Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257223292/08cf03d06233625eedf5c513cbae6522541bc70e/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1761590451"}],"name":"Tape 101 ","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> WINDOWS\u00ae 10+(64-BIT Required) or above<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel\u00ae Core\u2122 i3-9th Gen or AMD CPU equivalant<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1650 TI (4GB) or AMD GPU equivalant for 60 FPS+ on Low Settings.<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version